/E (Companies like Amazon handle a large number of deliveries daily, where selecting the optimal route, predicting delivery time, and managing resources efficiently become major challenges. Traditional systems often focus only on shortest path calculations, ignoring other important factors such as delivery patterns, traffic conditions, and decision-making based on historical data. This leads to increased fuel consumption, delays, and reduced operational efficiency.)
