<<
/Title (In addition to basic attributes, the dataset can also include derived features such as  estimated travel time, traffic conditions, and route complexity. These features  enhance the capability of machine learning models by providing deeper insights into delivery patterns. By incorporating such information, the system becomes more capable of handling real-world scenarios where multiple factors influence delivery performance.)
