<<
/Title (Furthermore, the dataset is structured in a way that supports both supervised and unsupervised learning techniques. For example, clustering models like K-Means use  unlabeled data to group delivery locations, while supervised models such as Logistic Regression and Decision Trees use labeled data for classification and prediction tasks.  This flexibility allows the system to apply different analytical approaches, making it more robust and effective in optimizing delivery operations.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 632 0 R
/Next 636 0 R
>>
